      "explanation": "The doctor maintained decision safety by discouraging immediate panic about引产, explaining that next steps depend on prenatal-diagnosis consultation, gestational age, reports, and informed discussion. No admission or induction-medication state was confirmed by the patient in the visible conversation.",
